nsert_V2, reused as-is). ErrorCode defaults to "UNKNOWN_CODE" when a caller forgets to set the DPP - a real ERROR_CODE_REGISTRY row for that code was seeded (Util_Seed_UnknownErrorCode) so this fallback path doesn't violate FK_ERROR_QUEUE_ERROR_CODE. MIGRATED 2026-09-25 from MySQL/Database (Legacy) to SQL Server/Database V2: Message steps build JSON directly for the V2 connectors' named ($param) request profiles - no Map component needed. Passthrough start so it can be Process-Called from any interface's (or framework subprocess's) catch path. | built with boomi-companion v1.0.57</bns:description><bns:object><process xmlns="" allowSimultaneous="false" enableUserLog="false" processLogOnErrorOnly="false" purgeDataImmediately="false" stopProcessingIfZeroDocuments="true" updateRunDates="false" workload="general"><shapes><shape image="start" name="shape1" shapetype="start" userlabel="" x="47.0" y="46.0"><configuration><passthroughaction/></configuration><dragpoints><dragpoint name="shape1.dragpoint1" toShape="shape2" x="240.0" y="56.0"/></dragpoints></shape><shape image="message_icon" name="shape2" shapetype="message" userlabel="Build ErrorCode lookup request JSON" x="255.0" y="48.0"><configuration><message combined="false"><msgTxt>'
